(7194104, 1106393, 136392, '<td valign="top">This DQ is very frustrating! I received NO warning of 48 hours notice to produce original (which I have no problem doing) and the notification of the DQ  was my FIRST notification.  I replied to the email  to understand and received no answer. Needless to say I am NOT happy, and feel this incident was handled poorly.  I am not angry because I didn''t win, but that I wasn''t even given a chance to be considered.  Not sure I want to continue with this site if this is the  standard operating procedure!  I might sound like a spoiled toddler with this rant, but I want my  frustration noted.<br/> <br/>I thought the blurred coins should be obvious and I am surprised that I was ''called'' out on it.  I wanted to make the coins look generic not a US JFK silver dollar. If I had more time, I would have tried to find more generic looking gold coins..</td>', 'This DQ is very frustrating! I received NO warning of 48 hours notice to produce original (which I have no problem doing) and the notification of the DQ  was my FIRST notification.  I replied to the email  to understand and received no answer. Needless to say I am NOT happy, and feel this incident was handled poorly.  I am not angry because I didn''t win, but that I wasn''t even given a chance to be considered.  Not sure I want to continue with this site if this is the  standard operating procedure!  I might sound like a spoiled toddler with this rant, but I want my  frustration noted. I thought the blurred coins should be obvious and I am surprised that I was ''called'' out on it.  I wanted to make the coins look generic not a US JFK silver dollar. If I had more time, I would have tried to find more generic looking gold coins..', '2014-03-26 02:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
