(7195153, 1106393, 58667, '<td valign="top">First, that doesn''t sound good about how the matter was handled - sorry to hear about it.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure the coin blurring would result in a DQ, but to be honest, such an obvious blur won''t do well anyway. This would have looked great had you not blurred the coins. And I guess the time issue is the point - make do with the time allotted or make time to get the materials you want.<br/> <br/>Hard luck with the DQ (I reckon the cloned BG might have DQ''d you anyway), but I hope you carry on submitting to the challenges here.</td>', 'First, that doesn''t sound good about how the matter was handled - sorry to hear about it. I''m not sure the coin blurring would result in a DQ, but to be honest, such an obvious blur won''t do well anyway. This would have looked great had you not blurred the coins. And I guess the time issue is the point - make do with the time allotted or make time to get the materials you want. Hard luck with the DQ (I reckon the cloned BG might have DQ''d you anyway), but I hope you carry on submitting to the challenges here.', '2014-03-28 06:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
